Welcome to this week's Top 7, where the DEV editorial team handpicks their favorite posts from the previous week. Congrats to all the authors that made it onto the list 👏 CSS Optical Illusions: 50+ Visual Illusions Built with Pure CSS and HTML Alvaro Montoro ・ Jan 22 #css #html #showdev #webdev
